3 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🛠️ <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"961\">Skills Used</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tConcept Development\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tVector Illustration\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tTypography and Lettering\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tColor Theory and Psychology\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\tScalability and Versatility\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100%\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>🎯 <strong data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1458\">Design Purpose</strong></h2>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t<ul><li data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"191\"><p data-start=\"97\" data-end=\"191\">Craft iconic logos that instantly connect with audiences and leave a lasting impression.</p></li><li data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"295\"><p data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"295\">Blend creativity and strategy, delivering designs that tell a brand’s unique story at a glance.</p></li><li data-start=\"296\" data-end=\"398\"><p data-start=\"298\" data-end=\"398\">Ensure every logo is versatile and impactful, shining equally on a business card or billboard.</p></li><li data-start=\"399\" data-end=\"495\"><p data-start=\"401\" data-end=\"495\">Create timeless marks that grow with the brand, staying relevant across trends and time.</p></li></ul>"
